#. ja: ウェザードツールベルト
#. de: verschlissen[a] Werkzeuggürtel
#. fr: ceinture à outils usée
#. column 2: weathered tool belts
#. column 8: Before becoming obsolete due to advancements in tailoring, belts such as this were used for holding up trousers and the like.
#. column 9: Weathered Tool Belt
msgctxt "Item:1475:0:0"
msgid "weathered tool belt"
msgstr "потёртый пояс для инструментов"

#. de: verschlissen[a] Werkzeuggürtel
